    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin a STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (10 men from the TKB composite) holds (300,300) under a Defend order (the generic StochasticUnitDefend); a PHYSICAL 'Red Squad' stands 480 m north - inside the resolution manager's band, outside its rifles' reach - so the squad de-aggregates. Judge (X-2): (1) the squad splits; (2) within 3 s of the handover it runs SquadDefend - the SAME order, re-resolved at its new resolution by the routing table - and never the stochastic play again; (3) its 10 men are in its roster, each its subordinate (the leader SquadLeader). Fail: the squad keeps the stochastic play over its men, an empty roster, or no order after the split. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-split-keeps-order"
  },
